const eduColors={'Illiterate':'#fa7188','Literate':'#f6ad49','5th Pass':'#ffcb4e','8th Pass':'#c6e84c','10th Pass':'#64d9b1','12th Pass':'#34d3dc','Graduate':'#37b4ff','Post Graduate':'#a28aff','Doctorate':'#ed77ed'};
const nameKey=s=>String(s).toLowerCase().replace(/teacher|advocate|adv\.|dr\./g,'').replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,'').replace('kunjhalikutty','kunhalikutty');
